"Again?!
My belly is already sloshing with water.
If we run into an enemy at a time like this..."{w}

"In that case...
perhaps Hess alone could drink
enough for all six of us?"{w}

"Oh, young master, really!
If we helped you, we would only tarnish
your long-awaited first battle."{w}

"Ah, Master!
At last, the young master's first battle is here!
To think this day would come..."{w}

"D-don't yell at me!
If you nag me like that,
none of it goes in!"{w}

"The young master is just a little pitiful
in the head, you see. Could you treat him
with a bit more pity?"{w}

"My apologies, Master Mirco.
To hound one already defeated in battle
was an act contrary to chivalry."{w}

"He may be like this now, but someday
he will become a fine lord who carries
House Lenzer on his shoulders..."{w}

"Fwahahahaha!!
You withstood my demon axe in full -- splendid!!"{w}{p}"Very well,
I shall recognize you as worthy rivals to Mirco!{w}...You there -- and you as well, Mirco!!"{w}

"Compete to your hearts' content and sharpen one another!{w}This strength of yours may one day
change the very shape of the world."{w}{p}"Until that day, farewell!{w}That you crossed blades with Dalisiamarte and still live --
take pride in it for the rest of your days!!"{w}

"I was just wonderin' when that kid'll
finally be fit to ride on my back,
but..."{w}

"I am Zephal, sword tutor to Master Mirco,
in service to House Lenzer!"{w}{p}"With my dark swordsmanship,
allow me to give you a lesson as well!!"{w}

"Don't worry, I'll be back soon.
This land is unstable right now,
so coming and going is easy."{w}

"Pwah!!
Wh-what was that for, Gurtia!
Pinching me out of nowhere... Whoa!?"{w}

"Gwah...?!{w}Heh... Not giving it up easy, huh?"{w}{p}"Fine. Since you held up against my attack,
I'll let you lot hang on to it for a while."{w}{p}"The next time we meet,
I'll send you to your grave!!{w}Hahahahahaha!!"{w}

"GUAAAAAH?!
You punks... just lie still and get eateeen...!
That was supposed to be MY divine relic..."{w}{p}"You're SO annoyiiing!!{w}I'm gonna tell Zeshrom on yoooou!!{w}Serves you riiiiight!!"{w}

"...You look happy.
Is that how you used to be?"{w}{p}"Heh... That's a lovely smile.
You must have been pushing yourself terribly hard all this time."{w}

{0E}"You're happy I came back, right?
I mean... I... um...{0F}
I-it was okay for me to come back... wasn't it?"{w}

"No... th-that's a lie...{w}But...
you called... my name, didn't you..."{w}{p}"No... this is a lie...{w}I-it's a liiiie!
NOOOOOOOOOOOO!!"{w}

"D-damn iiit... Why...!
I... for your sake... even my life...{w}Fiona... Dehain... it's them..."{w}{p}"Why do they always, always, ALWAYS take away the things that are precious to me!?"{w}{p}"The life that had finally come into the world, the Four Sages...
Father, and Sarijana too!{w}And now, my future walking beside these kids!"{w}{p}"Fi... o... naaaaaaa!!"{w}

"Shut up!!
I am the Zefkaka, even without such things!"{w}{p}"Whatever Dehain says,
whatever this lot says!{w}I'm the one who created life, nurtured it, and saved it!"{w}{p}"I'm the one who should be the Earth Goddess!!"{w}

