*             Now a turnip field             *
*             Sometimes potatoes             *{0F}{w}

"It seems you still have far to go.
In the search for truth, there is no room for carelessness.
Strive to improve, day by day."{w}

"A test of strength?{w}...............With me?{w}{p}{0E}"A test of strength?
...............With me? {0F}Why???{w}Hmm... I do not quite understand the reason."{w}{p}"I do not understand, but if you wish it, I will face you.
However..."{w}

"Countless marks cover my body.{w}Their order is irregular, yet they hold meaning,
and they do not change as time passes."{w}{p}"Yet as time passes for those who look upon me,
the meaning they take from me changes too."{w}

"I am truly fair to all.{w}No fortune and no plea will make me turn;
I only walk on."{w}{p}"All you are allowed is to mark me off
with a long blade and a short one."{w}

"I am a projector without order.{w}In my world all things become fools
and take on a fleeting meaning."{w}{p}"Nothing binds me,
yet the rooster shall break my reign."{w}

"I am a noble house without a seam.{w}Your hands bring heat and water;
my master dies, and I am broken apart."{w}{p}"Then you gather up my remains
to adorn yourselves."{w}

"I am one who keeps on growing.
Yet the longer I grow,
the closer I come to the ground."{w}

"I am something you have.
Alone I mean nothing, and you did not choose me.
Rarely does another have the same."{w}

"I am everywhere.
At times I trouble people, delight them, serve them.
Even with your eyes closed, you can sense me."{w}

"I have endless faces.
All who come peer into my face,
and then they walk away."{w}
